PROJECT APPROACH
================================================================================

Core principle:

    This is an implementation-first infrastructure project.

    We are building a realistic IT environment, not following
    a theoretical learning course.

Workflow:

    DESIGN
        ↓
    IMPLEMENT
        ↓
    TEST / TROUBLESHOOT
        ↓
    DOCUMENT
        ↓
    REVIEW ACTUAL STATE
        ↓
    COMMIT
        ↓
    NEXT IMPLEMENTATION


Learning model:

    No standalone lectures or learning stages.

    If a concept is unclear during implementation,
    stop and discuss that specific concept as needed,
    then continue implementing.


Important principle:

    Documentation follows the actual implemented state.

    Planned architecture is not represented as completed
    infrastructure until it has been implemented and verified.


